+### AndroidBindingGenerator
+
+With `Microsoft.Android.BindingGenerator.Semantic` referenced using
+`PrivateAssets="all"`, `Semantic` selects the packaged Java/Kotlin semantic
+compiler. Blank or `Legacy` retains the installed workload's generator.
+The initial preview requires `IsBindingProject=true`, `net11.0-android`, and
+Android workload 37.x; unlike the general properties above, the preview is
+currently restricted to separate binding projects.
+
+See [AndroidBindingGenerator](../../building-apps/build-properties.md#androidbindinggenerator)
+for ownership, compatibility, and runtime boundaries. This is a local preview,
+not a package already released on NuGet.org.
+
 ### AndroidBoundInterfacesContainConstants
 
 A boolean property that specifies if binding constants on interfaces will be supported, or if the legacy workaround of creating an `IMyInterfaceConsts` class will be used.
