+## AndroidBindingGenerator
+
+An experimental **package-owned** compiler selector, not a released workload
+feature. With `Microsoft.Android.BindingGenerator.Semantic` referenced
+privately in an SDK-style Android binding project, `Semantic` selects its
+matched parser, official Kotlin/JVM descriptor reader, and semantic generator.
+Blank or `Legacy` keeps the installed workload's generator.
+
+The preview currently targets `net11.0-android` with Android workload 37.x.
+Selection affects only the binding project and Android inner builds. It does
+not rewrite dependency DLLs, change assembly ownership or native packaging,
+or implicitly add Kotlin runtime dependencies. Existing metadata, namespace
+replacements and handwritten code remain inputs; review API differences when
+switching. See the package README for local packing and runtime requirements.
+
